    <node id="范蠡">
      <data key="d0">范蠡</data>
      <data key="d1">人物</data>
      <data key="d2">Fan Li, a prominent official and strategist of the Yue state, is traditionally depicted as a loyal minister serving under King Goujian. According to this portrayal, he combined strategic acumen with deep loyalty, advising on innovative tactics such as employing master-apprentice techniques to forge swords. He played an active role in planning actions against adversaries—for instance, taking part in schemes designed to counter prominent figures linked to the Wu state—and is credited with mediating conflicts between Yue and foreign emissaries. In some accounts, Fan Li is even portrayed as a commanding military leader who directed long swordmen to capture enemy cities, with his personal relationships, notably his deep connections with figures like Xi Shi, further underlining his multifaceted influence in both political and military arenas.

Alternatively, another narrative presents Fan Li as a distinctive and unconventional figure rooted in Chu traditions. In this account, he is described as a charismatic yet eccentric personality—often referred to locally as "Fan the Madman"—who occupies a ministerial role while also engaging in pastoral pursuits such as shepherding and recounting regional legends. This version emphasizes his unorthodox views and behavior, his renowned skill in swordsmanship as evidenced by his command over local guards, and his intimate association with a character known as A-Qing. Additionally, his noted friendship with figures like Wen Zhong contributes to a portrayal that is less conventional and blends official duties with a lively, idiosyncratic approach to life.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f89960ee186e8b69358a7a5c384a3ee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a72fd2ce03a23a58c65d98d2258f3e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-939cc8f0980bb7b81255939246f7fe66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42c3e318eb3b9f5e9c1bd450e13ff5b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8283a4a379ab2b74495b2a64a83b7b40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb8a415d6907f0cafb86835c412854f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e93cef7b7f368309937f9f274b9ad084&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f3e590b3ab7f94ee3770d3739196401&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6f4631a6bc7286dd9560f06b9845d9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76f36e0abe52b904e30fbb2a78b9a4a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-013870c1938481d1558d4c2e439c83d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b2a680eed881fd86d938031d895d21e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f20b87683fe0cc8608a321ff18feb71</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
