    <node id="越国">
      <data key="d0">越国</data>
      <data key="d1">地点</data>
      <data key="d2">The entity 越国 is an ancient Chinese state known primarily for its rule under 勾践, whose leadership is frequently highlighted across various accounts. Historical and legendary narratives of 越国 associate the state not only with 勾践’s reign but also with other prominent figures such as 范蠡, who is noted for his strategic acumen, as well as renowned individuals like 欧冶子 and 文种. These narratives characterize 越国 as a realm deeply involved in military affairs and strategic conflicts, particularly noted for its engagements with the rival 吴国.

Additional accounts emphasize 越国's cultural and martial significance, often referring to its acclaimed military traditions. Some sources highlight the presence of notable defenders, the 越国卫士, while others recount episodes of elaborate schemes—such as Fan Li’s strategic disguise and escape involving 白公公—to overcome adversaries. Together, these descriptions portray 越国 as a state marked by celebrated leadership, significant military exploits, and enduring historical legends that underscore both its political and cultural legacy.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2a72fd2ce03a23a58c65d98d2258f3e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-939cc8f0980bb7b81255939246f7fe66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8283a4a379ab2b74495b2a64a83b7b40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e93cef7b7f368309937f9f274b9ad084&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f3e590b3ab7f94ee3770d3739196401&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6f4631a6bc7286dd9560f06b9845d9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76f36e0abe52b904e30fbb2a78b9a4a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-013870c1938481d1558d4c2e439c83d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b2a680eed881fd86d938031d895d21e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f20b87683fe0cc8608a321ff18feb71</data>
