    <node id="吴国">
      <data key="d0">吴国</data>
      <data key="d1">地点</data>
      <data key="d2">吴国 is an ancient Chinese state known for its military prowess and frequent conflicts with the neighboring state of 越国. Historical and narrative accounts depict 吴国 as a powerful entity frequently engaged in warfare with 越国, highlighting a long-standing enmity between the two states.

Contemporary stories and historical references emphasize 吴国 as the homeland of renowned figures, including a celebrated swordsmith and its ruling 吴王. In some accounts, 吴国 is noted as the state where Fuchai (夫差), an influential historical figure, held power, further underscoring its significance and martial reputation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f89960ee186e8b69358a7a5c384a3ee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a72fd2ce03a23a58c65d98d2258f3e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-939cc8f0980bb7b81255939246f7fe66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e93cef7b7f368309937f9f274b9ad084&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f3e590b3ab7f94ee3770d3739196401&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6f4631a6bc7286dd9560f06b9845d9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76f36e0abe52b904e30fbb2a78b9a4a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b2a680eed881fd86d938031d895d21e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f20b87683fe0cc8608a321ff18feb71</data>
