    <edge source="阿青" target="范蠡">
      <data key="d7">10.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relationship between 范蠡 and 阿青 is characterized by a deep, multifaceted connection that includes elements of admiration, care, and both playful and protective behaviors. Multiple descriptions indicate that 范蠡 has expressed strong affection toward 阿青, inviting her to share meals and demonstrating a sincere concern for her well-being. He not only cherishes and values her—sometimes even treating her like a beloved pet—but also offers guidance in delicate matters, as shown when he cautioned her against actions that could inadvertently cause fatal harm to an opponent.

At the same time, the dynamic between them is portrayed as mutually affectionate, with accounts noting that both individuals rely on each other and share genuine, if sometimes conflicting, feelings. While some descriptions emphasize 范蠡’s intense infatuation and romantic interest towards 阿青, another narrative characterizes his affection as almost akin to that of an elder sibling toward a younger sister. This duality suggests that the relationship may encompass both romantic and platonic dimensions, reflecting its complexity and the varying perspectives of those involved.

Moreover, the context surrounding the relationship involves intriguing external interactions. There are instances where the name of 范蠡 is called out in hostile tones from beyond palace walls, and decisions are made to meet outside the palace gate to discern 阿青’s true intentions during unfolding events. In addition, 阿青 herself is depicted as engaging directly with 范蠡—demonstrated by her playful act of pulling a white hair from his beard—highlighting a dynamic that is not only affectionate but also interactive and nuanced.</data>
      <data key="d9">关联,情感,提及</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-f89960ee186e8b69358a7a5c384a3ee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-939cc8f0980bb7b81255939246f7fe66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8283a4a379ab2b74495b2a64a83b7b40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb8a415d6907f0cafb86835c412854f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e93cef7b7f368309937f9f274b9ad084&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-013870c1938481d1558d4c2e439c83d6</data>
